Package: mmirage
Type: Package
Title: Two-Trait MIRAGE for Joint Rare-Variant Gene Discovery
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Qishi", "Zhan", email = "qishi.zhan@marquette.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Shengtong", "Han", email = "shengtong.han@marquette.edu", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Implements mMIRAGE, a two-trait extension of MIRAGE for
    gene-level rare-variant analysis from variant-level case-control summary
    counts. The package includes the four-state joint empirical-Bayes model,
    Bayesian FDR utilities, convergence diagnostics, and a simple
    gene-level burden-test baseline.
